      en: ["The Phu Kham Copper-Gold Operation began commercial production in 2008.", "The mine is operated by Phu Bia Mining, a subsidiary of PanAust Limited.", "It is situated in Xaisomboun Province, northeast of the capital Vientiane.", "The Ban Houayxai Gold-Silver Operation was commissioned in April 2012.", "Phu Bia Mining is one of the highest tax-paying entities in Laos.", "The operation exports copper concentrate primarily to smelters in Asia."],
