      en: ["The Vientiane Logistics Park was officially opened in December 2021.", "It is located near the First Thai-Lao Friendship Bridge in Hadxayfong District.", "The total estimated investment for the project is approximately $727 million.", "The park is a key component of the 'land-linked' strategy of the Lao government.", "It provides a comprehensive one-stop service for international customs clearance.", "The facility is integrated with the Thanaleng Dry Port for multimodal transport."],
