      en: ["The total installed capacity of the Hongsa Power Plant is 1,878 megawatts.", "The facility consists of three generating units, each with a 626 MW capacity.", "Commercial operations for all units were achieved by the end of 2015.", "The power plant is fueled by lignite from a dedicated 60 sq km mining area.", "Approximately 1,473 MW of power is exported to Thailand via 500kV lines.", "The project is a joint venture involving Banpu Power and Ratch Group."],
      es: ["Central eléctrica alimentada por carbón", "Capacidad de 1878 megavatios", "Puesta en funcionamiento en 2015", "Utiliza lignito local", "Provincia de Xayabury", "80 por ciento de exportación de energía a Tailandia"],
      pt: ["Central elétrica movida a carvão", "Capacidade de 1878 megawatts", "Entrada em funcionamento em 2015", "Utiliza lenhite local", "Província de Xayabury", "80 por cento de exportação de energia para a Tailândia"],
      fr: ["Centrale électrique alimentée au charbon", "Capacité de 1878 mégawatts", "Mise en service en 2015", "Utilise du lignite local", "Province de Xayabury", "80 pour cent d'exportation d'électricité vers la Thaïlande"],
