      en: ["The zone is the primary land-based gateway for Lao-Chinese trade.", "Top exports through the zone include rubber, bananas, and cassava.", "The Kunming-Bangkok Expressway serves as a major logistical artery here.", "Boten is the primary administrative and commercial center within the zone.", "New agricultural inspection centers have been built to facilitate food exports.", "The zone is a critical part of the North-South Economic Corridor (NSEC)."],
      es: ["Comercio con la provincia china de Yunnan", "Cerca del paso fronterizo Mohan-Boten", "Incluye mercados mayoristas y almacenes aduaneros", "Exporta caucho y bananas", "Importa maquinaria china", "Conectada con la Ruta 3"],
      pt: ["Comércio com a província chinesa de Yunnan", "Perto da passagem fronteiriça Mohan-Boten", "Inclui mercados grossistas e armazéns alfandegados", "Exporta borracha e bananas", "Importa maquinaria chinesa", "Ligada à Rota 3"],
      fr: ["Commerce avec la province chinoise du Yunnan", "Proche du poste frontière de Mohan-Boten", "Comprend des marchés de gros et des entrepôts douaniers", "Exporte du caoutchouc et des bananes", "Importe des machines chinoises", "Reliée à la route 3"],
