      en: ["VITA Park is located approximately 22 kilometers northeast of Vientiane.", "It is a joint venture between the Lao government and Taiwanese investors.", "The industrial park covers a total area of roughly 110 hectares.", "The zone features a one-stop service center for business licenses.", "Major industries include garment manufacturing and electronics assembly.", "VITA Park provides dedicated infrastructure, including stable electricity and water."],
      es: ["A 22 kilómetros de Vientiane", "Empresa conjunta con inversores extranjeros", "Más de 110 hectáreas de superficie", "Foco en industria ligera y textiles", "Ofrece servicio integral para la administración", "Producción orientada a la exportación"],
      pt: ["A 22 quilómetros de Vientiane", "Joint venture com investidores estrangeiros", "Mais de 110 hectares de área", "Foco na indústria ligeira e têxteis", "Oferece serviço de balcão único para administração", "Produção orientada para a exportação"],
      fr: ["À 22 kilomètres de Vientiane", "Coentreprise avec des investisseurs étrangers", "Plus de 110 hectares de superficie", "Accent sur l'industrie légère et le textile", "Offre un service de guichet unique administratif", "Production orientée vers l'exportation"],
