      en: ["Located in the Golden Triangle on the banks of the Mekong.", "Developed and managed by the Kings Romans Group.", "Features the Bokeo International Airport, officially opened in 2024.", "Holds the status of an autonomous economic zone.", "Primary sectors include tourism, gambling, and trade.", "The zone's total area covers several thousand hectares."],
      es: ["Ubicada en el punto de unión de tres países.", "Grandes hoteles-casino y comercios minoristas.", "Principalmente capital extranjero.", "Marco legal semiautónomo.", "Enfoque en turismo transfronterizo.", "Utiliza el Mekong para el transporte."],
